//│ class-tags web-computation-phase >   producers: A@0, Altered@1
//│ class-tags web-computation-phase >   pattern matches: match@2
//│ <<< end class-tags web-computation-phase
//│ >>> start class-tags transform-phase
//│ class-tags transform-phase > allocated tag 0 for A(x: 0)
//│ ╔══[COMPILATION ERROR] Class tags do not support mutable fields yet.
//│ ║  l.150: 	class Altered(mut val x) with
//│ ╙──       	                      ^
//│ class-tags transform-phase > allocated tag 1 for Altered(x: A(x: 0))
